        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Josefa wakafwambaana kuyandaula cilililo, nkaambo moyo wakwe wakali kuyandisya mwanike wakwe. Wakanjila muŋanda yakoonena, walilila nkuko. ",
          "type": "text",
