                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bakabikilwa zipampwido kubusyu bwakwe, pele cipampwido ca-Benjamini cakainda zipampwido zyabo zyoonse zyeelelo zyosanwe. Elyo bakanywa akunywisya awe.",
